# Workload-derived Full/SWA attention canonical image, revision 2.
#
# R2 closes the immutable-image DFX gap exposed by the bs1/64K gate: prepared
# workers can reuse a preceding dep-gen capture for an unperturbed swimlane
# timing pass.  The image otherwise keeps the exact R1 attention/runtime pins.
# Build with:
#   bash build.sh builds/stepfun-develop-20260805-attn-final-canonical-r2.env
